{"openapi":"3.0.0","paths":{"/v1/predictions":{"get":{"description":"Returns a paginated, filtered, and sorted list of trading predictions.\n\n**filter** — JSON object using Prisma-style operators (raw or URL-encoded).\nAllowed fields: `status`, `direction`, `execution_status`, `asset`, `issuer_address`, `leverage`, `performance`, `opened_at`, `closed_at`, `entry_price`, `exit_price`\n\n**sort** — comma-separated `field:order` pairs (e.g. `opened_at:desc,performance:asc`).\nAllowed fields: `opened_at`, `closed_at`, `performance`, `entry_price`, `leverage`\n\n**Examples**\n```\nGET /v1/predictions?filter={\"status\":{\"equals\":\"open\"}}&sort=opened_at:desc&limit=20\nGET /v1/predictions?filter={\"OR\":[{\"direction\":{\"equals\":\"long\"}},{\"leverage\":{\"gte\":5}}]}\n```","operationId":"PredictionsController_findAll","parameters":[{"name":"offset","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Number of records to skip (default 0)","schema":{"example":0}},{"name":"limit","required":false,"in":"query","description":"Page size (default 50)","schema":{"example":50}},{"name":"sort","required":false,"in":"query","allowReserved":true,"description":"Comma-separated field:order pairs","schema":{"example":"opened_at:desc"}},{"name":"filter","required":false,"in":"query","allowReserved":true,"description":"JSON filter object (raw or URL-encoded)","schema":{"example":"{\"status\":{\"equals\":\"open\"}}"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PredictionsPageDto"}}}}},"summary":"List predictions","tags":["Predictions"]},"post":{"operationId":"PredictionsController_ingest","parameters":[],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SanrPredictionDto"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":""},"400":{"description":"","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ErrorResponseDto"}}}},"401":{"description":"","content":{"application/j